<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-size: 10pt">Emerging
growth company </span><span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_907_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20250404__20250404_zhzxx9gFXrI"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-04-04" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000028" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#168;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

